=   entry .Error   raised when a parameter a value needs is missing from a query
-     detail
+     detail

-         Error `↯/s.87.2`: _the query parameter could not be read because the parameter was not
-         present in the query string_. Raised by the `Decodable in Query` givens when a value
-         which is required has no parameter, and focused at that field's `Pointer` when a case
-         class is decoded, so an accruing strategy reports every missing field of a form.
+         Erro `↯/s.87.2`: _the query parameter could not be read because the parameter was not
+         present in the query string_. Lançado pelos givens `Decodable in Query` quando um valor
+         obrigatório não tem parâmetro, e focado no `Pointer` desse campo quando uma case class é
+         decodificada, para que uma estratégia acumulativa relate cada campo ausente de um formulário.

